  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Ay, ay, ay...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOye, ¿tú podrías ayudarme a buscar una cosa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410079002C002000610079002C002000610079002E002E002E00100001BE01000A004F00790065002C002000BF007400FA00200070006F0064007200ED006100730020006100790075006400610072006D006500200061002000620075007300630061007200200075006E006100200063006F00730061003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Resulta que... he perdido mi anillo aquí,\nen el Cementerio Bonnuit.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500730075006C007400610020007100750065002E002E002E0020006800650020007000650072006400690064006F0020006D006900200061006E0069006C006C006F002000610071007500ED002C000A0065006E00200065006C002000430065006D0065006E0074006500720069006F00200042006F006E006E007500690074002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estaba visitando una de las tumbas cuando,\nde repente, apareció un Pokémon salvaje y<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nme caí al suelo del susto. Ayyy...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con tanto Pokémon suelto, hasta el cementerio\nse ha convertido en una zona salvaje.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¡Dónde iremos a parar!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Y para colmo he perdido mi anillo!\n¡Si es que no gano para disgustos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Juraría que el Pokémon que me asustó era\nun Sableye.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi la memoria no me falla, creo que su único\npunto débil es el tipo Hada, así que ten eso<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen cuenta si te lo encuentras.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 184
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El anillo se me cayó por la parte más al fondo\ndel cementerio.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTen cuidado si vas a buscarlo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ese Sableye... parece que tiene el anillo que\nla anciana te pidió que buscaras.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres combatir contra él para recuperarlo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200063006F006E007400720061002000E9006C002000700061007200610020007200650063007500700065007200610072006C006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatiré!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D0062006100740069007200E900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora mismo no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F007200610020006D00690073006D006F0020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bleyeee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10042006C0065007900650065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Sableye ha soltado el Anillo Preciado\ny ha salido corriendo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020005300610062006C00650079006500200068006100200073006F006C007400610064006F00200065006C00200041006E0069006C006C006F00200050007200650063006900610064006F000A0079002000680061002000730061006C00690064006F00200063006F0072007200690065006E0064006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Sableye tenía el Anillo Preciado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020005300610062006C006500790065002000740065006E00ED006100200065006C00200041006E0069006C006C006F00200050007200650063006900610064006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Llévaselo a la anciana!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006C00E90076006100730065006C006F002000610020006C006100200061006E006300690061006E0061002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sabes algo de mi anillo?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEspero que no se lo haya zampado un Pokémon\nsalvaje o algo peor...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Anda! ¡Pero si lo has encontrado!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041006E006400610021002000A1005000650072006F0020007300690020006C006F002000680061007300200065006E0063006F006E0074007200610064006F002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has devuelto el Anillo Preciado.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610073002000640065007600750065006C0074006F00200065006C00200041006E0069006C006C006F00200050007200650063006900610064006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Dices que lo tenía el Sableye?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044006900630065007300200071007500650020006C006F002000740065006E00ED006100200065006C0020005300610062006C006500790065003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nunca habría pensado que un Pokémon salvaje\npudiera interesarse por mi anillo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPero está claro que tiene buen gusto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero por mucho que le guste no se lo puedo dar.\nEs la alianza de boda que me regaló mi marido<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny no quiero separarme de ella.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias.\nQuiero darte esto como agradecimiento.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E000A00510075006900650072006F0020006400610072007400650020006500730074006F00200063006F006D006F002000610067007200610064006500630069006D00690065006E0074006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voy a pedir que cuando muera coloquen el anillo\nsobre mi tumba.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F00790020006100200070006500640069007200200071007500650020006300750061006E0064006F0020006D007500650072006100200063006F006C006F007100750065006E00200065006C00200061006E0069006C006C006F000A0073006F0062007200650020006D0069002000740075006D00620061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quién sabe? Quizá ese Sableye venga a por él.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00510075006900E9006E00200073006100620065003F0020005100750069007A00E100200065007300650020005300610062006C006500790065002000760065006E006700610020006100200070006F0072002000E9006C002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seguro que se pondría muy contento.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSerá una manera de recompensar tan buen\ngusto para las joyas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me consuela el pensar que, cuando yo ya no esté,\nel Sableye seguirá cuidando de mi tesoro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
